			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"可莉",
					"凯亚"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401171301,
					"content": "…对了，之前凯亚哥哥答应可莉，要给可莉讲完瓶中镇灵的故事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401171302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401171302,
					"content": "好啊，嗯…上次说到什么地方来着？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401171303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 401171303,
					"content": "可莉记得，说是「魔瓶」里出来的「镇灵」，想要啊呜一口吃掉打开瓶子的牧童。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401171304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401171304,
					"content": "对对，就在坏镇灵张开血盆大口的时候，牧童突然灵机一动…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401171305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 401171305,
					"content": "把蹦蹦炸弹扔进了镇灵嘴里？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401171306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401171306,
					"content": "哈哈，如果那个时候牧童身边有蹦蹦炸弹，他一定也会这么做的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401171307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 401171307,
					"content": "但是牧童从来没见过炸弹这种东西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401171314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 401171314,
					"content": "他只能对镇灵说：「等等，你那么大的身子，真的是从瓶子里出来的吗？除非我见到，不然我可不信！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401171308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 401171308,
					"content": "镇灵很生气，说：「哇呀呀，可恶的小牧童，你怎么可以小瞧我。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401171309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 401171309,
					"content": "镇灵说完就钻回了瓶子，牧童眼疾手快，把瓶塞塞了回去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401171310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 401171310,
					"content": "真好，这样坏镇灵就再也没法跑出来了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401171311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401171311,
					"content": "不过…一直被关在了瓶子那么小的地方，坏镇灵会不会睡不好觉？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401171312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401171312,
					"content": "那也是因为它做了坏事，被抓住，才被关在里面的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401171313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 401171313,
					"content": "所以如果做了坏事不想被关，最关键的就是不能被别人抓到…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401171314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4011714,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
